# OfficeFC functions — deploy-time environment. Copy to `.env` on the machine that runs
# `firebase deploy` (the .env file itself is gitignored; firebase-tools loads it at deploy).
#
# Sentry DSN for the officefc-functions project (a public identifier, not a secret).
# Leave empty / omit to ship with Sentry disabled — module load logs `sentry_disabled`.
SENTRY_DSN=
